            <ArticleTitle>Localized scleroderma-like lesions on the legs in bone marrow transplant recipients: association with polyneuropathy in the same distribution.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>201-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report two patients who developed localized scleroderma-like lesions on the legs following bone marrow transplantation. These changes were associated with a polyneuropathy in the same distribution.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
